{"code":0,"data":{"title":"前置下单并支付接口","content":"<h1 id=\"s-2717j8qb\">一、接口说明</h1><p>该接口为前置下单并支付接口，开发者调用该接口前置传递支付方式信息，vivo支付平台内直接下单并构建返回对应支付方式的支付信息。</p><h1 id=\"s-6vu6dszb\"><br>二、接口请求</h1><p>请求地址： <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://openpay.vivo.com.cn/gateway\">https://openpay.vivo.com.cn/gateway</a></p><p>Headers：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>参数值</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Content-Type</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>application/x-www-form-urlencoded</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"s-9bchn1uj\">2.1 公共参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"82\" style=\"width: 82px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"70\" style=\"width: 70px\"><p><strong>是否必传</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"358\" style=\"width: 358px\"><p><strong>示例</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"730\" style=\"width: 730px\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>version</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"82\" style=\"width: 82px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"70\" style=\"width: 70px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"358\" style=\"width: 358px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1.0.0</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"730\" style=\"width: 730px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】接口版本号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"82\" style=\"width: 82px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"70\" style=\"width: 70px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"358\" style=\"width: 358px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>vivopay.front.trade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"730\" style=\"width: 730px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】使用的接口服务名称</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>appId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"82\" style=\"width: 82px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"70\" style=\"width: 70px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"358\" style=\"width: 358px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>2019002536451112</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"730\" style=\"width: 730px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】应用编号，创建应用时分配</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>timestamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"82\" style=\"width: 82px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"70\" style=\"width: 70px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"358\" style=\"width: 358px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20180724030750</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"730\" style=\"width: 730px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】发送请求的时间，格式：yyyyMMddHHmmss</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"82\" style=\"width: 82px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"70\" style=\"width: 70px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"358\" style=\"width: 358px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>ALKHIKYQUIHLBNLAHKLHLHJL</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"730\" style=\"width: 730px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】签名，用于验签，签名字段获取见<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/815#s-z1vxu1cv\">服务端接入指南-请求加签与验签</a></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>signType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"82\" style=\"width: 82px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"70\" style=\"width: 70px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"358\" style=\"width: 358px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>RSA</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"730\" style=\"width: 730px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】签名方式，固定RSA</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"127\" style=\"width: 127px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>bizContent</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"82\" style=\"width: 82px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Json</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"70\" style=\"width: 70px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"358\" style=\"width: 358px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>{\"merchantOrderNo\":\"20190316154879313465\"}</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"730\" style=\"width: 730px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【公共请求参数】请求参数的集合，最大长度不限，下文 2.2、bizContent业务参数所有请求参数都必须放在这个参数中传递；<br>格式：业务参数拼接成的Json对象字符串。建议通过vivo pay sdk传参。传参参数为 VivopayFrontTradeRequest，Model对象为 VivoPayFrontTradeModel</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id=\"s-595rpoo9\">2.2 bizContent 业务参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>是否必传</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>示例</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>QUICK_APP_SERVICE_PROVIDER</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>交易类型，即商户与支付签约的产品码，快应用固定为 QUICK_APP_SERVICE_PROVIDER</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>merchantOrderNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20190316154879313465</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商户订单号，开发者自己的订单号，需保证订单号在该应用下唯一 (订单长度不能大于64个字符)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityName</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>iQOO Neo5 12GB+256GB 云影蓝</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品名称用于收银台展示（最长128个字符）</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityDesc</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>iQOO Neo5 12GB+256GB 云影蓝</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品描述，用于收银台展示（最长256个字符）</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>0</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品类型，0=虚拟类，1=实体类，当前参数无实际业务逻辑。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityDetails</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>[{\"commodityCount\":\"1\",\"commodityId\":\"120464\",<br>\"commodityPrice\":\"299900\",\"commodityName\":\"iQOO<br>Neo5 12GB+256GB 云影蓝\"}</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品详情，json数组格式的字符串信息，最长512字符。字段详解见2.2.1，</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>100</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>交易金额，单位分</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>notifyUrl</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://openpay.vivo.com.cn/gateway\">http://xxx.xx.com/callback</a></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付完成回调通知URL，最长256个字符</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>extInfo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>拓展参数 回调通知会原样返回</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>expiredTime</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>20250106024042</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>订单过期时间，格式：yyyyMMddHHmmss, 订单超过过期时间将无法支付</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"165\" style=\"width: 165px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>paymentWays</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"93\" style=\"width: 93px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>[{\"paymentWayCode\":\"ALIPAY_APP\",<br>\"payAmount\":\"4900\"}]</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付信息，json数组格式的字符串信息，字段详解见2.2.2</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"s-ilj0jk0f\">2.2.1 commodityDetails 中商品对象信息</h3><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"164\" style=\"width: 164px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>是否必传</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"164\" style=\"width: 164px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品id，仅作信息留存，如若没有开发者可自行传String格式数据即可</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"164\" style=\"width: 164px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityName</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品名称 ,仅作信息留存(字段最大长度不能超过256个字符,不能为空或空字符)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"164\" style=\"width: 164px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityPrice</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品单价，单位分</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"164\" style=\"width: 164px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityCount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>购买数量</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"s-kygj88zm\">2.2.2 paymentWays 支付方式映射编码</h3><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"167\" style=\"width: 167px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>是否必传</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"167\" style=\"width: 167px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>paymentWayCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付方式编码,详见 2.2.3 支付方式映射编码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"167\" style=\"width: 167px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>payAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付金额，单位为分</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"s-z6ln7leg\">2.2.3 支付方式映射编码</h3><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>支付方式编码</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>名称</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>ALIPAY_APP</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付宝支付</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>WECHAT_APP</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>微信支付</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>WECHAT_INDIRECT_APP</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>微信间联支付</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 id=\"s-nwb4arvj\"><br>三、接口响应</h1><h2 id=\"s-jzkz8ijh\">3.1 响应参数</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>code</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>msg</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>返回码描述</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>bizCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>业务返回码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>bizMsg</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>业务返回码描述</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>签名</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>signType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>签名方式，固定值RSA</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>appId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>应用id</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeType</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>交易类型，快应用固定为 QUICK_APP_SERVICE_PROVIDER</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeOrderNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>vivo交易订单号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>交易金额，单位分</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>discountAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>【历史废弃字段-无需关注】优惠金额，单位分</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>commodityDesc</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>商品描述</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>paymentWayInfo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Object</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付方式信息，字段为对象格式，详见3.1.1</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"162\" style=\"width: 162px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>payInfo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>Object</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>预下单参数，字段为对象格式，开发者无需关注字段内容，直接将该参数体透传至快应用引擎使用即可，详见3.1.2</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"s-g03wxskw\">3.1.1 paymentWayInfo 支付方式对象信息</h3><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>paymentWayCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付方式编码,详见 2.2.3 支付方式映射编码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>payAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付金额，单位为分</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=\"s-abt4mw77\">3.1.2 payInfo 支付参数信息</h3><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>参数</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\"><p><strong>备注</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>appId</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>应用id</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>payParam</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付渠道的参数</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>vCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>接口版本号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>paymentWayCode</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>支付方式编码</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeOrderNo</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>vivo交易订单号</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>tradeAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>交易金额，单位分</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>payAmount</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>交易金额，单位分；该字段与tradeAmount相同。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h1 id=\"s-mldy99q8\"><br>四、示例</h1><h2 id=\"s-kaloovzt\">4.1 java-sdk 请求示例</h2><pre><code>public class VivopayFrontTradeDemo {\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws VivopayApiException {\n\n        VivoClient vivoClient = new DefaultVivoClient(\"RSA\", 应用私钥,vivo支付平台公钥,http网关地址, \"UTF-8\");\n        VivopayFrontTradeRequest request = new VivopayFrontTradeRequest();\n        request.setAppId(appid);\n        request.setTimestamp(new Date());\n        request.setBizModel(getBizModel());\n\n        VivopayFrontTradeResponse response = vivoClient.execute(request);\n        if(response.isSuccess()){\n            System.out.println(\"调用成功:\" + JSON.toJSONString(response));\n        } else {\n            System.out.println(\"调用失败:\" + JSON.toJSONString(response));\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static VivoPayFrontTradeModel getBizModel(){\n        VivoPayFrontTradeModel bizModel = new VivoPayFrontTradeModel();\n        bizModel.setMerchantOrderNo(\"7318303471234\");\n        ......\n        return bizModel;\n    }\n}</code></pre><h2 id=\"s-vbm7gen7\">4.2 响应示例</h2><ul><li><p>请求返回值中 code = 10000 且 bizCode = S 代表请求响应成功，响应成功后开发者还需进行验签确认返回信息可信，验签逻辑同<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/815#s-z1vxu1cv\">服务端接入指南-请求加签与验签</a></p></li><li><p>如果是 java sdk 开发者无需关注，sdk 会对返回值自动进行验签</p></li></ul><pre><code>{\n    \"msg\": \"success\",\n    \"code\": \"10000\",\n    \"bizCode\": \"S\",\n    \"sign\": \"EvHlc1SmPCOSGZczE735dwJozuEqXAD6bzLniz7yNXxR44zS/2FMHFE022UzgBUg3wQYPXTv5yG9U92DGiYMwzqn5wS3HvN3rYQgonA+P0tf8OjOE3GovV6fhJUlQleYsyxHqXWCETPS3kKfEnS56cLCM4ZHqlizYgO4SXuOeYPKO/N9tyJHpXaSWk8ou4ESz2mTolQ==\",\n    \"discountAmount\": \"0\",\n    \"paymentWayInfo\": [\n        {\n            \"payAmount\": \"100\",\n            \"paymentWayCode\": \"ALIPAY_APP\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"tradeOrderNo\": \"20240126840457902111832\",\n    \"tradeAmount\": \"100\",\n    \"bizMsg\": \"SUCCESS\",\n    \"appid\": \"1012331301\",\n    \"signType\": \"RSA\",\n    \"commodityDesc\": \"商品\",\n    \"payInfo\": {\n        \"tradeAmount\": \"100\",\n        \"payAmount\": \"100\",\n        \"appId\": \"1012331301\",\n        \"tradeOrderNo\": \"20240126840457902111832\",\n        \"payParam\": \"app_idxxxxxxxx\",\n        \"paymentWayCode\": \"ALIPAY_APP\",\n        \"vCode\": \"2.0\"\n    },\n    \"tradeType\": \"QUICK_APP_SERVICE_PROVIDER\"\n}</code></pre><h1 id=\"s-9v58bze7\"><br>五、返回码说明</h1><h2 id=\"s-ufx0s867\">5.1 code 返回码说明</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"105\" style=\"width: 105px\"><p><strong>code</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"226\" style=\"width: 226px\"><p><strong>描述返回码说明</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"105\" style=\"width: 105px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>10000</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"226\" style=\"width: 226px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>success</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"105\" style=\"width: 105px\" data-type=\"tableCell